<title>UK: Thermo Instrument extends Life Sciences bid.</title>
<headline>Thermo Instrument extends Life Sciences bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. firm Thermo Instrument Systems Inc said on Wednesday it had extended to March 4 its estimated 235.9 million stg agreed cash offer Britain's Life Sciences International Plc. Thermo said that as of 1500 GMT on Tuesday, it had received valid acceptances in respect of 111.5 million shares representing 63.84 percent of the scientific equipment producer's issued share capital.</p>
<p>Thermo Instrument said it had also bought 5.7 million shares in Life Sciences, representing 3.26 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
